Here is a complete, single-file solution containing HTML and CSS. I have designed a modern, clean interface suitable for a grocery store called **"FreshMarket."**

I have included a custom SVG logo (so you don't need an image file) and styled the search bar and navigation for responsiveness.

You can save the code below as an `.html` file (e.g., `index.html`) and open it in any browser.

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>FreshMarket | Local Grocery Store</title>
    <style>
        /* --- General Reset & Typography --- */
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
        }

        body {
            background-color: #f9f9f9;
            color: #333;
        }

        /* --- Header Wrapper --- */
        header {
            background-color: #ffffff;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
            position: sticky;
            top: 0;
            z-index: 1000;
        }

        .header-container {
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 15px 20px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
        }

        /* --- 1. The Logo --- */
        .logo {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            text-decoration: none;
            color: #2c3e50;
        }

        .logo svg {
            width: 40px;
            height: 40px;
            margin-right: 10px;
        }

        .logo-text {
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        .logo-text span {
            color: #27ae60; /* Fresh Green */
        }

        /* --- 2. Navigation Bar --- */
        .nav-bar ul {
            list-style: none;
            display: flex;
            gap: 25px;
        }

        .nav-bar a {
            text-decoration: none;
            color: #555;
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 16px;
            transition: color 0.3s ease;
        }

        .nav-bar a:hover {
            color: #27ae60;
        }

        .cart-icon {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 5px;
            background-color: #27ae60;
            color: white !important;
            padding: 8px 15px;
            border-radius: 20px;
        }

        /* --- 3. Search Box --- */
        .search-container {
            display: flex;
            background-color: #f1f1f1;
            border-radius: 25px;
            padding: 5px 15px;
            border: 1px solid #ddd;
        }

        .search-container:focus-within {
            background-color: #fff;
            border-color: #27ae60;
            box-shadow: 0 0 5px rgba(39, 174, 96, 0.2);
        }

        .search-container input {
            border: none;
            background: transparent;
            outline: none;
            padding: 8px;
            font-size: 14px;
            width: 200px;
        }

        .search-container button {
            background: none;
            border: none;
            cursor: pointer;
            color: #777;
            transition: color 0.3s;
        }

        .search-container button:hover {
            color: #27ae60;
        }

        /* --- Main Content Placeholder (To show it works) --- */
        .hero {
            background: linear-gradient(rgba(0,0,0,0.5), rgba(0,0,0,0.5)), url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1542838132-92c53300491e?ixlib=rb-1.2.1&auto=format&fit=crop&w=1350&q=80');
            background-size: cover;
            background-position: center;
            height: 400px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            text-align: center;
            color: white;
        }

        .hero h1 {
            font-size: 48px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .hero button {
            padding: 12px 30px;
            background-color: #27ae60;
            color: white;
            border: none;
            font-size: 18px;
            border-radius: 5px;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: background 0.3s;
        }

        .hero button:hover {
            background-color: #219150;
        }

        /* --- Responsive Design (Mobile) --- */
        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .header-container {
                flex-direction: column;
                gap: 15px;
            }

            .nav-bar ul {
                gap: 15px;
                font-size: 14px;
            }

            .search-container input {
                width: 150px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <!-- HEADER SECTION -->
    <header>
        <div class="header-container">

            <!-- 1. LOGO -->
            <a href="#" class="logo">
                <!-- SVG Icon of a Leaf -->
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                    <path d="M12 22C12 22 20 18 20 12V5H12L2 12V18C2 18 10 22 12 22Z" stroke="#27ae60" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
                    <path d="M12 22V12" stroke="#27ae60" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
                    <path d="M12 12L7.5 7.5" stroke="#27ae60" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
                </svg>
                <div class="logo-text">Fresh<span>Market</span></div>
            </a>

            <!-- 2. NAVIGATION BAR -->
            <nav class="nav-bar">
                <ul>
                    <li><a href="#">Produce</a></li>
                    <li><a href="#">Meat & Fish</a></li>
                    <li><a href="#">Bakery</a></li>
                    <li><a href="#">Weekly Deals</a></li>
                    <li><a href="#" class="cart-icon">Cart (0)</a></li>
                </ul>
            </nav>

            <!-- 3. SEARCH BOX -->
            <div class="search-container">
                <input type="text" placeholder="Search for items...">
                <button type="submit">
                    <!-- Search Icon SVG -->
                    <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                        <circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"></circle>
                        <line x1="21" y1="21" x2="16.65" y2="16.65"></line>
                    </svg>
                </button>
            </div>

        </div>
    </header>

    <!-- MAIN HERO SECTION (For visual context) -->
    <section class="hero">
        <div>
            <h1>Freshly Picked, <br>Delivered Daily</h1>
            <button>Shop Now</button>
        </div>
    </section>

</body>
</html>
```

### Key Features of this design:

1.  **The Logo:** I used an SVG (Scalable Vector Graphic) code directly inside the HTML. This creates a leaf icon without needing to download an image file. It scales perfectly on any screen.
2.  **Navigation Bar:**
    *   It uses Flexbox to align items horizontally.
    *   It includes hover effects (changes color when you move the mouse over it).
    *   I added a "Cart" button styled differently to make it stand out, which is standard for grocery/e-commerce sites.
3.  **Search Box:**
    *   It features a clean, rounded "pill" shape.
    *   It has a focus state: when you click inside the text box, the border turns green to indicate it's active.
4.  **Responsiveness:** If you resize your browser window to be small (like a mobile phone), the header will stack vertically so the elements remain usable.
